'''''Sicyos''''' is a [[flowering plant]] [[genus]] of the [[Family (taxonomy)|family]] [[Cucurbitaceae]].<ref>{{cite web | title = Sicyos | publisher = The Plant List  | url = http://www.theplantlist.org/browse/A/Cucurbitaceae/Sicyos/ |accessdate =2020-12-24}}</ref>  Members of the genus may be known as '''burr cucumbers''',<ref name="ITIS">{{ITIS |id=22400 |taxon=''Sicyos'' |accessdate=2011-03-04}}</ref> but the genus includes ''[[Sicyos edulis]]'' which is the christophine or chayote.

